<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>動名詞 宿題 — 英検3級</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --blue-dark:#1a56a8; --blue-mid:#2563eb; --blue-light:#60a5fa;
  --blue-pale:#dbeafe; --blue-bg:#eff6ff;
  --green:#10b981; --yellow:#f59e0b; --red:#ef4444; --purple:#8b5cf6;
  --text:#1e293b; --gray:#64748b; --radius:14px;
}
*{ box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
.file-nav {
  background: #1e3a5f;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  gap: 12px;
}
.file-nav-current { color: #fcd34d; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.file-nav-link {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;
  text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); transition: background .15s;
}
.file-nav-link:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
body{
  font-family:'Nunito','Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;
  font-size:17px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dbeafe 0%,#eff6ff 60%,#e0f2fe 100%);
  color:var(--text); min-height:100vh;
}

/* ===== HEADER ===== */
.hero{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-mid),#0ea5e9);
  color:white; text-align:center; padding:28px 20px 22px;
}
.hero-badge{
  display:inline-block; background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);
  border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); border-radius:100px;
  padding:4px 16px; font-size:.82rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;
}
.hero h1{ font-size:clamp(1.7rem,5vw,2.6rem); font-weight:900; margin-bottom:6px; }
.hero h1 span{ color:#fcd34d; }
.hero p{ font-size:.95rem; opacity:.88; }

/* ===== SCORE BAR ===== */
.score-bar{
  background:white; box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  padding:10px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:200; gap:10px;
}
.score-num{ font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue-mid); }
.score-label{ font-size:.9rem; font-weight:700; }
.btn-print{
  padding:7px 18px; border-radius:100px; border:2px solid var(--blue-mid);
  background:white; color:var(--blue-mid); font-family:inherit;
  font-size:.88rem; font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s;
}
.btn-print:hover{ background:var(--blue-mid); color:white; }

/* ===== MAIN ===== */
.main{ padding:14px 14px 120px; max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; }

/* ===== SECTION CARD ===== */
.sec-card{
  background:white; border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(37,99,235,.13);
  padding:22px; margin-bottom:18px;
}
.sec-head{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:6px; }
.sec-icon{
  width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--blue-pale); display:flex; align-items:center;
  justify-content:center; font-size:1.5rem; flex-shrink:0;
}
.sec-head h2{ font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue-dark); }
.sec-desc{ font-size:.88rem; color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:18px; line-height:1.6; }

/* ===== PUN BOX ===== */
.pun-box{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef9c3,#fef3c7);
  border:2px dashed var(--yellow); border-radius:12px;
  padding:12px 16px; font-size:.92rem; margin-bottom:18px;
  display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; line-height:1.65;
}
.pun-box strong{ color:#92400e; }

/* ===== Q ITEM ===== */
.q-item{ margin-bottom:20px; }
.q-num{
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue-mid); color:white;
  font-size:.82rem; font-weight:900; margin-right:8px; flex-shrink:0;
}
.q-text{ font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:10px; }
.q-text .blank{
  display:inline-block; border-bottom:2.5px solid var(--blue-mid);
  min-width:110px; text-align:center; color:var(--blue-mid); font-weight:900;
}
.q-jp{ font-size:.9rem; color:var(--gray); margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:10px; }

/* 4択 */
.choices{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px; }
.choice{
  padding:11px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:2px solid #e2e8f0;
  background:white; font-family:inherit; font-size:1rem; font-weight:600;
  cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s; text-align:center;
  display:grid; place-items:center; min-height:52px;
}
.choice:hover{ border-color:var(--blue-mid); background:var(--blue-pale); }
.choice.correct{ border-color:var(--green); background:#dcfce7; color:#15803d; }
.choice.wrong{ border-color:var(--red); background:#fee2e2; color:#b91c1c; }

/* 用法識別 */
.usage-choices{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.uc-btn{
  padding:9px 20px; border-radius:100px; border:2px solid #e2e8f0;
  background:white; font-family:inherit; font-size:.97rem; font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s;
}
.uc-btn:hover{ border-color:var(--blue-mid); background:var(--blue-pale); }
.uc-btn.subj{ --col:#1d4ed8; }
.uc-btn.obj { --col:#15803d; }
.uc-btn.prep{ --col:#7e22ce; }
.uc-btn.correct{ border-color:var(--col); background:var(--blue-pale); color:var(--col); font-weight:900; }
.uc-btn.wrong{ border-color:var(--red); background:#fee2e2; color:#b91c1c; }

/* 空欄補充 */
.fill-wrap{ display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:4px; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600; line-height:2; }
.fill-input{
  border:none; border-bottom:2.5px solid var(--blue-mid);
  outline:none; font-family:inherit; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--blue-mid); width:140px; text-align:center;
  background:transparent; padding:2px 4px;
}
.fill-input.correct{ border-color:var(--green); color:var(--green); }
.fill-input.wrong  { border-color:var(--red);   color:var(--red);   }

/* 並び替え */
.sort-pool{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-bottom:10px; }
.sort-word{
  padding:8px 15px; border-radius:100px;
  border:2px solid var(--blue-mid); background:white;
  font-family:inherit; font-size:.97rem; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--blue-dark); cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s; user-select:none;
}
.sort-word:hover{ background:var(--blue-pale); transform:translateY(-2px); }
.sort-word.used{ opacity:.3; pointer-events:none; }
.sort-word.to-w{ color:#059669; background:#dcfce7; border-color:#10b981; }
.sort-display{
  min-height:50px; border:2px dashed var(--blue-light);
  border-radius:10px; padding:10px 12px; display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;
  background:var(--blue-bg);
}
.sort-display.has-w{ border-style:solid; border-color:var(--blue-mid); }
.sort-placed{
  padding:7px 14px; border-radius:100px; background:var(--blue-mid);
  color:white; font-size:.92rem; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;
}
.sort-placed.to-w{ background:#059669; }
.sort-placed:hover{ background:var(--blue-dark); }
.drop-hint{ color:var(--gray); font-size:.88rem; }

/* feedback */
.q-feedback{
  margin-top:8px; padding:10px 14px; border-radius:10px;
  font-size:.92rem; line-height:1.65; display:none;
}
.q-feedback.show{ display:block; }
.q-feedback.ok{ background:#dcfce7; border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0; color:#15803d; }
.q-feedback.ng{ background:#fee2e2; border:1.5px solid #fecaca; color:#b91c1c; }
.fb-title{ font-weight:800; font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:3px; }

/* check btn */
.btn-check{
  padding:10px 24px; border-radius:10px; border:none;
  background:var(--green); color:white; font-family:inherit;
  font-size:.97rem; font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; margin-top:6px;
  transition:background .15s;
}
.btn-check:hover{ background:#059669; }
.btn-check:disabled{ background:#cbd5e1; cursor:default; }

/* 英作文 */
.eisaku-area{
  width:100%; min-height:70px; border:2px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px; font-family:inherit;
  font-size:1rem; resize:vertical; outline:none; transition:border .15s;
  line-height:1.7;
}
.eisaku-area:focus{ border-color:var(--blue-mid); }
.eisaku-hint{
  font-size:.85rem; color:var(--gray); margin-top:6px;
  background:var(--blue-bg); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px;
}

/* result banner */
.result-banner{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-mid));
  color:white; border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px 24px;
  text-align:center; margin-bottom:18px; display:none;
}
.result-banner.show{ display:block; }
.result-banner .medal{ font-size:4rem; margin-bottom:10px; }
.result-banner h3{ font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:8px; }
.result-banner p{ font-size:1rem; opacity:.88; line-height:1.7; }
.result-banner .big{ font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:900; color:#fcd34d; }

/* btn-all-check */
.btn-all{
  display:block; width:100%; padding:16px;
  border-radius:14px; border:none; background:var(--blue-mid);
  color:white; font-family:inherit; font-size:1.1rem;
  font-weight:900; cursor:pointer; transition:background .15s;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.btn-all:hover{ background:var(--blue-dark); }

/* ===== OVERLAY PEN ===== */
#overlayCanvas{
  position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%;
  z-index:500; pointer-events:none; touch-action:none;
}
#overlayCanvas.pen-active{ pointer-events:all; cursor:crosshair; }
.pen-fab{
  position:fixed; bottom:24px; right:18px; z-index:600;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:8px;
}
.pen-toggle{
  width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; border:none;
  background:var(--blue-mid); color:white; font-size:1.5rem;
  cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(37,99,235,.4);
  transition:background .2s; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
}
.pen-toggle:hover{ background:var(--blue-dark); }
.pen-toggle.active{ background:#ef4444; }
.pen-panel{
  background:white; border-radius:14px;
  box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
  padding:14px; display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; min-width:190px;
}
.pen-panel.open{ display:flex; }
.pen-row{ display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; }
.pen-row-label{ font-size:.76rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:2px; }
.pen-color{
  width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%;
  border:2.5px solid transparent; cursor:pointer; transition:transform .1s;
}
.pen-color.active{ border-color:#1e293b; transform:scale(1.3); }
.pen-size{
  width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%;
  border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0; background:white;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  cursor:pointer; font-weight:700; font-size:.72rem; color:var(--gray);
}
.pen-size.active{ border-color:var(--blue-mid); color:var(--blue-mid); background:var(--blue-pale); }
.pen-tool-row{ display:flex; gap:6px; }
.ptool-btn{
  flex:1; padding:6px 4px; border-radius:8px;
  border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0; background:white;
  font-family:inherit; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer; color:var(--gray); text-align:center;
}
.ptool-btn.active{ background:var(--blue-mid); color:white; border-color:var(--blue-mid); }
.ptool-btn.eraser.active{ background:var(--gray); border-color:var(--gray); }
.btn-clear-overlay{
  width:100%; padding:7px; border-radius:8px;
  border:1.5px solid #fca5a5; background:white;
  color:#ef4444; font-family:inherit; font-size:.85rem; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;
}
.btn-clear-overlay:hover{ background:#fee2e2; }

/* ===== CONFETTI ===== */
#confettiCanvas{ position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; pointer-events:none; z-index:800; }

/* ===== TOAST ===== */
.toast{
  position:fixed; bottom:80px; left:50%;
  transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(200px); opacity:0;
  background:#1e293b; color:white; padding:10px 24px;
  border-radius:100px; font-weight:700; font-size:.92rem;
  z-index:999; transition:transform .3s,opacity .3s;
  pointer-events:none; white-space:nowrap;
}
.toast.show{ transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity:1; }

/* ===== PRINT ===== */
.print-answer-page{ display:none; }

@media print{
  * { -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact!important; print-color-adjust:exact!important; }
  body{ background:white!important; font-size:11.5pt; }
  .score-bar, .pen-fab, #overlayCanvas, #confettiCanvas,
  .btn-print, .btn-all, .result-banner, .pun-box,
  .q-feedback, .btn-check, .file-nav, .hero { display:none!important; }
  .main{ padding:0; max-width:100%; }
  .sec-card{
    box-shadow:none!important; border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;
    border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px;
    break-inside:avoid; page-break-inside:avoid;
  }
  .sec-head h2{ font-size:12pt; color:#1a56a8!important; }
  .sec-desc{ font-size:9.5pt; }
  .print-header{ display:block!important; border-bottom:2px solid #1a56a8; padding-bottom:10px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .choices{ display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .choice{
    border:1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius:6px;
    padding:6px 14px; font-size:10.5pt; min-height:auto; background:white!important;
  }
  .choice::before{ content:'□ '; font-size:10pt; color:#475569; }
  .usage-choices{ display:flex; gap:10px; }
  .uc-btn{ border:1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius:100px; padding:5px 14px; font-size:10pt; background:white!important; }
  .fill-input{ border:none; border-bottom:2px solid #333; width:140px; font-size:11pt; background:transparent!important; }
  .sort-pool{ gap:6px; }
  .sort-word{ border:1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius:100px; padding:5px 12px; font-size:10pt; background:white!important; }
  .sort-display{ display:none!important; }
  .sort-pool::before{ content:'【語群】'; font-size:9pt; color:#64748b; font-weight:700; display:block; width:100%; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .sort-answer-line{ display:block!important; border-bottom:1.5px solid #333; height:28px; margin:8px 0 4px; width:100%; }
  .eisaku-area{ border:1px solid #94a3b8; min-height:60px; font-size:11pt; background:#fafafa!important; }
  .print-answer-page{ display:block!important; page-break-before:always; padding:20px; }
  .ans-title{ font-size:14pt; font-weight:900; color:#1a56a8; border-bottom:2px solid #1a56a8; padding-bottom:8px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .ans-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px 24px; font-size:10.5pt; }
  .ans-item{ padding:4px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .ans-num{ font-weight:800; color:#1a56a8; margin-right:8px; }
  .ans-val{ font-weight:700; }
}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .choices{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .usage-choices{ flex-direction:column; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="confettiCanvas"></canvas>
<canvas id="overlayCanvas"></canvas>


<!-- 印刷時のみ表示されるヘッダー -->
<div class="print-header" style="display:none; padding:16px 20px 10px; font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;">
  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; margin-bottom:8px;">
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:9pt; color:#64748b; margin-bottom:2px;">英検3級 · 動名詞（gerund）</div>
      <div style="font-size:15pt; font-weight:900; color:#1a56a8;">⚗️ 動名詞ミッション 練習問題</div>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:9.5pt; color:#475569;">
      名前：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿　　　点数：＿＿＿＿／220点
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">🔬 英検3級 · 動名詞 練習問題</div>
  <h1>⚗️ 動名詞<span>ミッション</span> 問題集</h1>
  <p>全4ステージ・22問 ＋ 英作文チャレンジ！動名詞マスターを目指せ！</p>
</div>

<!-- SCORE BAR -->
<div class="score-bar">
  <div><span class="score-label">⭐ スコア </span><span class="score-num" id="totalScore">0</span><span class="score-label"> pt</span></div>
  <div><span class="score-label" id="correctCount">0</span><span class="score-label"> / <span id="totalQ">0</span> 正解</span></div>
  <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ 印刷</button>
</div>

<div class="main">

<!-- ===== STAGE 1: 4択 ===== -->
<div class="sec-card">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-icon">🧪</div>
    <div><h2>Stage 1｜正しい形を選べ！（4択）</h2></div>
  </div>
  <p class="sec-desc">( ) に入る正しいものを①〜④から選んでタップしよう。</p>
  <div class="pun-box">
    <span style="font-size:1.4rem">⚗️</span>
    <div><strong>ダジャレ①</strong> 「ing」を日本語で読むと「いんぐ」。動名詞をマスターすれば英語力が「<em>引力（いんりょく）</em>」のように周りを引き寄せる！🌍</div>
  </div>
  <div id="stage1"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== STAGE 2: 用法識別 ===== -->
<div class="sec-card">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-icon">🔭</div>
    <div><h2>Stage 2｜用法を識別せよ！</h2></div>
  </div>
  <p class="sec-desc">下線部の動名詞が「主語用法・目的語用法・前置詞用法」のどれかをタップしよう。</p>
  <div class="pun-box">
    <span style="font-size:1.4rem">🧬</span>
    <div><strong>ダジャレ②</strong> 動名詞の3用法は元素の3状態（固体・液体・気体）みたい！<br>主語→固体（どっしり文頭），目的語→液体（動詞にくっつく），前置詞→気体（前置詞の後でフワッと）⚡</div>
  </div>
  <div id="stage2"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== STAGE 3: 空欄補充 ===== -->
<div class="sec-card">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-icon">🧬</div>
    <div><h2>Stage 3｜空欄を埋めよ！</h2></div>
  </div>
  <p class="sec-desc">日本語を参考に，（　）に適切な英語を入れよう。「答え合わせ」ボタンで確認できるよ。</p>
  <div class="pun-box">
    <span style="font-size:1.4rem">🔬</span>
    <div><strong>ダジャレ③</strong> 「enjoy」の語源は「喜びの中へ入る」。<em>Enjoy filling in the blanks!</em> 空欄を埋めることを楽しもう！😄</div>
  </div>
  <div id="stage3"></div>
  <button class="btn-check" id="checkStage3" onclick="checkFill()">✅ 答え合わせ</button>
</div>

<!-- ===== STAGE 4: 並び替え ===== -->
<div class="sec-card">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-icon">🧩</div>
    <div><h2>Stage 4｜語句を並び替えよ！</h2></div>
  </div>
  <p class="sec-desc">単語をタップして正しい英文を作ろう。緑色が動名詞（-ing形）だよ。</p>
  <div id="stage4"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== STAGE 5: 英作文 ===== -->
<div class="sec-card">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-icon">✍️</div>
    <div><h2>Stage 5｜英作文チャレンジ！</h2></div>
  </div>
  <p class="sec-desc">自分のことを動名詞を使って書いてみよう！理科・数学・趣味…何でもOK！</p>
  <div class="pun-box">
    <span style="font-size:1.4rem">🏆</span>
    <div><strong>ダジャレ④</strong> 動名詞は「動く名詞」= 電子みたいにいつもグルグル動いている⚡<br>自分の「動き」を英語で書き出そう！</div>
  </div>
  <div id="stage5"></div>
</div>

<!-- ALL CHECK -->
<button class="btn-all" onclick="showResult()">🎓 全問チェック！スコアを出す</button>

<!-- RESULT -->
<div class="result-banner" id="resultBanner">
  <div class="medal" id="rMedal">🏆</div>
  <h3 id="rTitle">ミッション完了！</h3>
  <div class="big" id="rScore"></div>
  <p id="rMsg"></p>
